flowchart LR
  A[Source order / idempotency key] --> B[Account price + quote approval]
  B --> C[Inventory and fulfillment router]
  C --> D[Warehouse / supplier / POD / manual]
  D --> E{Provider result}
  E -->|transient failure| F[Bounded backoff]
  F --> D
  E -->|threshold reached| G[Exception / severity / SLA]
  G --> H[Authorized human resolution]
  H --> D
  E -->|success| I[Shipment and invoice]
  I --> J[Payment / finance reconciliation]
  J --> K[Complete]
  L[(SQLite state + audit + receipts)] --- B
  L --- G
  L --- J
